# M28 Jacket (UE URemoveOccludedTrianglesTool, MeshOps palette "Mesh"): a Box 40 cm (scale 0.4) merged into a Box 100 cm so it sits wholly inside it -> Jacket (Winding Number, Vertices and Centroids) -> Accept -> Undo. Wireframe, seen from above and to the side.
# Both boxes are named "Box", so the selection is made by clicks: the inner box is placed on the outer one's surface at the viewport centre and clicked there, moved inside, and a Shift-click at the same point adds the outer box (its surface is now hit first).
Дано run View "View mode: Wireframe"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.3,-0.6,0.5
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Rotation 0,0,0
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Scale 0.4,0.4,0.4
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject viewport drag 718,428 718,428 1
Дано --subject selection set Rotation 0,0,0
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,30,0
Дано --subject viewport drag 718,428 718,428 1 --shift
Дано run Modeling "XForm: Merge"
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Тогда-вид 0_inner Wireframe: the outer box and, through it, the smaller inner box are both drawn
Когда run Modeling "Mesh tool: Jacket"
Когда run Modeling "Jacket occlusion mode: Winding Number"
Когда run Modeling "Jacket triangle sampling: Vertices and Centroids"
Тогда 1_panel the Mesh palette shows Jacket with Occlusion Mode Winding Number; the status reads "Jacket (...): N of M triangles removed" with N >= 12
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда 1_jacket Wireframe after Accept: only the outer box is drawn, the inner box is gone; the status line keeps the removed count (>= 12)
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда-вид 2_undo after Undo the inner box is drawn again through the outer one
